# MP-07 - Checkout with long and special-character inputs

## Priority
Medium

## Type
Edge

## Steps

1. Login with valid credentials.
2. Add a product to the cart and open the cart.
3. Click 'Checkout'.
4. Enter First Name with 256 characters (or maximum reasonable length supported) and special characters (e.g. "A!@#$%^&*()_+..."), Last Name similar long value, Postal Code: '12345-6789'.
5. Click 'Continue' and proceed to 'Finish'.

## Expected Result

Application accepts or gracefully truncates long/special-character inputs without crashing. User can complete checkout and receives order confirmation. If there are input length restrictions, meaningful validation messages are shown before submission.
